      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<FONT COLOR=\"#FFFFFF\"><B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Render View Diagrams</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tThe tooling SHALL render view diagrams (DOT sources plus SVG output) for the can<BR/>onical view set. Rendering MUST use a Graphviz-compatible DOT renderer (default <BR/>&apos;dot&apos;) and SHOULD allow overriding the executable via environment configuration <BR/>(AURORA_DOT_COMMAND).<BR/></FONT>\n\t\t\t",
